	\centering
	\includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{1_framework.pdf}
	\caption{ Overall diagram of the proposed MetaNAS, which combines six steps. We first obtain the individuals by initializing the population. The proposed MetaNAS framework is subsequently used to find the individuals with the best fitness to decode the best architecture.}
	\label{fig:1}
