\paragraph{Proof of optimality.} It suffices to show that the difference between the average response time under $\mathsf{NP}$-$\mathsf{SRPT}$  and the optimal algorithm is a lower order term, \ie,
\begin{align}\label{optcondi}
\lim_{n \rightarrow \infty}\frac{\mathbbm{E}{[F_{\rho}^{ \mathsf{NP-SRPT}}]}-\mathbbm{E}[F^{\mathrm{SRPT}_{1,N}}_{\rho}]}{\mathbbm{E}[F^{\mathrm{SRPT}_{1,N}}_{\rho}]}=0,
\end{align}
which holds according to Lemma~\ref{mg1bound} and inequality (\ref{unrefine})-(\ref{ineqq1}).

