Our semantic segmentation approach leverages key insights about how childlike drawings represent figures through abstract regions.
% Instead of attempting to identify all the semantic regions simultan.eously, CharSegNet employs a hierarchical, coarse-to-fine prediction strategy illustrated in Fig.~\ref{fig:architecture_c2f}.
CharSegNet employs a hierarchical, coarse-to-fine prediction strategy, as illustrated in Fig.~\ref{fig:architecture_c2f}, rather than identifying all semantic regions simultaneously.
By first understanding the broader structure before analyzing details, CharSegNet resolves ambiguous regions whose semantic meaning depends on their context with the figure.




