There are few instances with a large $R$. The percentage of instances with $R$ larger than $10$, $100$ and $1000$ is $13.43\%$, $1.34\%$ and $0.06\%$, respectively. The median $R$ is $2.63$. Observe that $R\geq \sqrt{2}$.
