when the time is measured in hours. The matrix has the four real negative eigenvalues $-0.038938\ \mathrm{h}^{-1}$, $-0.26104\ \mathrm{h}^{-1}$, $-0.92864\ \mathrm{h}^{-1}$ and  $-5.9588\ \mathrm{h}^{-1}$. The characteristic time is $25.7\ \mathrm{h}$. The rightmost left eigenvector is
