Like the Queen Bee, the Beetle moves one space per turn. Additionally, the Beetle can, unlike any other piece, move on top of another piece. A piece with a Beetle on top of it is unable to move. Once on top of the Hive, the Beetle can move from tile to tile or drop off again. See Figure \ref{fig: beetle}.

