\subsubsection{Ant} \label{subsubsec: ant}
The Ant can move any number of spaces to any place it can reach, provided it follows the One Hive rule and the Freedom To Move rule (sections \ref{subsubsec: one hive} and  \ref{subsubsec: freedom}). See Figure \ref{fig: ant} for an example.

