\subsection{Interviews}
To answer \textbf{RQ2} and \textbf{RQ3}, we conducted semi-structured interviews with 12 Mastodon moderators, focusing on how they perceive and utilize blocklists as well as blocklist-related tools.

\subsubsection{Participant Recruitment. }
