\begin{definition}
    Let $M : \Pscr \to \vect$ be a $\Pscr$-persistence module, and let $k \in \Nbb$.
    %A finite \emph{presentation} (resp.~\emph{minimal presentation}) of $M$, consists for morphisms $C_1 \to C_0 \to M$ composing to the zero morphism such that
    %\begin{itemize}
    %    \item $C_0$ and $C_1$ are finitely presentable;
