Plugging in the notations of $R_G$ and $R_F$:


\begin{align*}
(\alpha, x) = \begin{cases}
    (1, 0) & \mbox{$m \geq r^f$} \\
           & \mbox{or $R_G \geq 1$ and $m \geq \ol r^f$} \\
    \\
    (0, 0) & \mbox{$c > r^g$ and $m < r^f$}  \\
